WEBVTT

00:01:31.570 --> 00:01:32.650
Here we go!

00:01:32.650 --> 00:01:33.690
Come on!

00:01:33.690 --> 00:01:35.780
--Go Shoot!

00:01:37.910 --> 00:01:40.780
Against the mysterious boy, Ozma,

00:01:40.780 --> 00:01:44.000
Takao losing not once, but twice,

00:01:44.250 --> 00:01:48.290
was because he couldn't
summon Seiryu from Dragoon.

00:02:06.180 --> 00:02:09.600
Because he was so
frustrated in his situation,

00:02:09.600 --> 00:02:14.730
I developed a special training
regimen so he can call Seiryu again.

00:02:23.160 --> 00:02:23.990
But...

00:02:23.990 --> 00:02:25.870
Little did we know,

00:02:25.870 --> 00:02:30.540
that there was a mysterious
organization with their sights aimed

00:02:30.540 --> 00:02:34.170
at Takao's Dragoon and Seiryu.

00:02:34.170 --> 00:02:35.340
Who do you think you--

00:02:37.670 --> 00:02:40.220
Kyoujyu, what kind of
training do you have for me?

00:02:40.220 --> 00:02:41.680
It's getting me pumped!

00:02:56.360 --> 00:02:57.380
Huh?

00:02:58.030 --> 00:03:00.870
Kyoujyu! Kyoujyu!

00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:07.660
Where the heck is he?

00:03:07.660 --> 00:03:10.370
He told me "come quickly, please", too...

00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:13.370
If you don't show up, what's the point?

00:03:16.630 --> 00:03:18.920
Aren't these his glasses?

00:03:18.920 --> 00:03:20.980
What're they doing here?

00:03:26.140 --> 00:03:27.860
--Takao!

00:03:29.850 --> 00:03:31.730
Kyoujyu! Hiromi!

00:03:31.730 --> 00:03:34.080
Hey! Stop that car!

00:03:36.520 --> 00:03:39.280
I said stop, dammit!

00:03:39.280 --> 00:03:40.820
--Takao!

00:03:41.200 --> 00:03:43.360
I'll save you guys!

00:03:50.710 --> 00:03:52.250
Darn it...

00:03:55.130 --> 00:03:56.460
Wait!

00:04:00.470 --> 00:04:02.770
Where'd it go? Where?

00:04:15.440 --> 00:04:16.400
Hello?

00:04:16.400 --> 00:04:19.650
How unfortunate, Takao Kinomiya.

00:04:19.980 --> 00:04:21.400
Who the heck are you?

00:04:21.400 --> 00:04:26.620
We have our hands on Kyoujyu
and an incredibly rowdy little girl.

00:04:26.820 --> 00:04:29.290
What are you gonna do with them?

00:04:29.290 --> 00:04:31.660
That depends on you.

00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:33.330
On me?

00:04:33.330 --> 00:04:36.430
I don't get it! Don't play dumb with me!

00:04:36.430 --> 00:04:38.800
Takao Kinomiya...

00:04:38.800 --> 00:04:43.090
Follow our demands, and the two of them will be returned safely.

00:04:43.090 --> 00:04:44.550
If you don't, well,

00:04:44.550 --> 00:04:46.090
they will both die.

00:04:47.350 --> 00:04:48.550
What?!

00:04:48.550 --> 00:04:50.680
Go to the public park.

00:04:50.680 --> 00:04:54.060
In five minutes, the public
telephone will ring. It'll ring three times.

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:56.650
From there, you'll receive
the next instructions.

00:04:56.650 --> 00:05:01.150
Don't play games with me!
You won't get away with this!

00:05:01.150 --> 00:05:03.320
See you in five minutes.

00:05:03.320 --> 00:05:05.450
If you want to save them,

00:05:05.450 --> 00:05:07.730
don't contact the authorities.

00:05:08.990 --> 00:05:10.330
Hey, wait!

00:05:10.330 --> 00:05:11.660
Shoot!

00:05:11.660 --> 00:05:15.000
The public park in five
minutes? Give me a break!

00:05:21.710 --> 00:05:23.550
Kyoujyu... Hiromi...

00:05:23.550 --> 00:05:27.000
Hang on, I swear I'll save you two!

00:05:28.850 --> 00:05:30.930
Adrenaline, 400.

00:05:31.220 --> 00:05:33.350
Protein gain, 120.

00:05:33.350 --> 00:05:35.520
Mental readings, 300.

00:05:35.770 --> 00:05:38.690
Mark my words, I will unveil it.

00:05:38.690 --> 00:05:40.440
The secret...

00:05:40.440 --> 00:05:42.780
of those who command
the Sacred Beasts...

00:05:53.240 --> 00:05:54.750
There it is!

00:05:56.410 --> 00:05:58.080
Crap!

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:02.460
Go...

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:03.550
Shoot!

00:06:07.590 --> 00:06:08.890
Hello?

00:06:08.890 --> 00:06:10.850
Impressive work from the world champion.

00:06:10.850 --> 00:06:13.010
Your skills are commendable.

00:06:14.600 --> 00:06:18.350
Wait, are you watching me?

00:06:18.350 --> 00:06:20.810
Where the hell are you? Where?!

00:06:22.900 --> 00:06:25.400
Don't worry about it.

00:06:25.400 --> 00:06:29.320
You've got a lot left to do, after all.

00:06:29.740 --> 00:06:32.370
This time we need
you to work a little harder.

00:06:32.370 --> 00:06:34.790
It'll be the public telephone at Akebono Theater.

00:06:34.790 --> 00:06:36.290
You have ten minutes.

00:06:36.290 --> 00:06:39.750
As you might expect,
it'll ring three times.

00:06:39.920 --> 00:06:41.500
Ten minutes?

00:06:41.500 --> 00:06:44.930
You think I can make it all the way to Akebono Theater in ten minutes?

00:06:44.930 --> 00:06:46.380
Do it for your friends.

00:06:46.380 --> 00:06:48.020
Good luck.

00:06:48.590 --> 00:06:49.890
Rats!

00:06:55.100 --> 00:06:57.760
Adrenaline, increased to 900.

00:06:58.270 --> 00:07:00.980
Protein gain, 1,500.

00:07:00.980 --> 00:07:03.630
Mental readings, 300.

00:07:08.360 --> 00:07:11.360
The B point is set to
activate in thirty minutes.

00:07:11.360 --> 00:07:12.320
Yes, sir.

00:07:12.320 --> 00:07:14.030
Fifteen minutes.

00:07:16.740 --> 00:07:19.330
No matter how you
put it, fifteen is a little...

00:07:19.330 --> 00:07:22.170
That's twice as fast, right bro?

00:07:22.170 --> 00:07:24.500
Set the B point to fifteen minutes.

00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:25.630
Bro?

00:07:25.630 --> 00:07:28.400
B point set to fifteen minutes.

00:07:34.640 --> 00:07:36.560
You're rather quick, aren't you?

00:07:36.560 --> 00:07:40.940
What's the point of
making me do all this?

00:07:40.940 --> 00:07:42.440
You'll see.

00:07:42.440 --> 00:07:45.190
Next you'll go to pier
three at the harbor.

00:07:45.190 --> 00:07:47.150
You have fifteen minutes.

00:07:47.650 --> 00:07:51.850
Fifteen? That's a 30-minute trip!

00:07:52.660 --> 00:07:54.160
They're counting on you.

00:07:55.120 --> 00:07:56.640
Darn them!

00:07:59.040 --> 00:08:01.740
I think I'll make Oden tonight!

00:08:02.250 --> 00:08:05.750
Boiled daikon radishes
doesn't sound too bad, too!

00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:07.650
Decisions, decisions...

00:08:12.090 --> 00:08:13.910
Are you okay, Ms. Keiko?

00:08:14.260 --> 00:08:16.100
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:08:16.100 --> 00:08:18.180
I got lost in thought, and...

00:08:18.180 --> 00:08:20.130
Ms. Keiko, what time is it?

00:08:21.730 --> 00:08:23.640
It's 4:56.

00:08:23.640 --> 00:08:25.060
Just ten minutes left, then...

00:08:25.060 --> 00:08:27.660
I'm gonna borrow your
bike for a sec, Ms. Keiko!

00:08:30.400 --> 00:08:32.530
Don't go too fast, now!

00:08:33.530 --> 00:08:35.700
Wait, my radishes!

00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:51.600
Watch where you're going!

00:09:05.770 --> 00:09:07.940
Kids these days...

00:09:07.940 --> 00:09:10.150
Don't they know
that crap's dangerous?

00:09:10.150 --> 00:09:12.610
Help!!

00:09:19.030 --> 00:09:20.850
Holy smokes...

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:24.040
Adrenaline, 5,000.

00:09:24.620 --> 00:09:26.790
Protein gain, 7,000.

00:09:27.250 --> 00:09:29.360
Mental readings, 9,000.

00:09:29.710 --> 00:09:31.500
He's broken the 10k mark!

00:09:31.840 --> 00:09:35.840
Is this the power of one who
commands a Sacred Beast?

00:09:36.840 --> 00:09:39.290
Begin Project Z!

00:09:45.350 --> 00:09:47.460
I thought I was a goner...

00:09:49.690 --> 00:09:51.900
See, you can do it if you try.

00:09:51.900 --> 00:09:53.610
Don't give me that.

00:09:53.610 --> 00:09:56.030
Where do I go next?

00:09:56.030 --> 00:09:58.240
Get on that boat.

00:09:58.240 --> 00:10:00.080
You should see a ship in the sea.

00:10:00.320 --> 00:10:02.000
We'll be waiting there.

00:10:02.740 --> 00:10:04.070
A boat?

00:10:11.840 --> 00:10:13.130
Wait!

00:10:23.260 --> 00:10:24.500
Is that it?

00:10:37.240 --> 00:10:39.280
Kyoujyu! Hiromi!

00:10:39.280 --> 00:10:41.570
Anyone there?

00:10:54.380 --> 00:10:56.590
What is this room?

00:11:01.140 --> 00:11:02.520
Takao!

00:11:04.760 --> 00:11:06.180
Kyoujyu! Hiromi!

00:11:06.180 --> 00:11:08.560
Takao! You made it!

00:11:08.560 --> 00:11:11.020
What took you so long?

00:11:11.020 --> 00:11:12.940
What's with the attitude?

00:11:12.940 --> 00:11:14.520
I came to rescue you!

00:11:14.520 --> 00:11:16.860
Then hurry up
and do something!

00:11:17.530 --> 00:11:19.300
Get over yourself!

00:11:19.650 --> 00:11:20.770
Don't!

00:11:25.830 --> 00:11:27.330
How stupid are you?

00:11:27.330 --> 00:11:30.460
If that could've broken it we
would've done so already!

00:11:30.460 --> 00:11:33.670
Shaddup!
Alright, how about this?

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:36.750
Hey, Hiromi...

00:11:36.750 --> 00:11:40.130
I'm about to rescue you, so I'm free from
cleaning duty starting tomorrow right?

00:11:40.130 --> 00:11:42.720
Those are two
completely different issues.

00:11:43.390 --> 00:11:45.760
Don't waste your energy.

00:11:46.510 --> 00:11:49.140
Where are you?
Get the hell out here!

00:11:50.980 --> 00:11:55.860
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade 2002"

00:11:55.980 --> 00:12:00.950
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade 2002"

00:12:01.360 --> 00:12:02.860
Hey, hey, hey!

00:12:02.860 --> 00:12:05.450
Stop playing games
and show yourself!

00:12:05.660 --> 00:12:09.620
The police aren't going to
let you get away with this!

00:12:09.620 --> 00:12:11.250
Didn't you hear me?

00:12:11.250 --> 00:12:14.210
If you did then you better say so!

00:12:14.420 --> 00:12:16.590
Stop, you two!

00:12:16.590 --> 00:12:18.300
Don't be rude!

00:12:18.300 --> 00:12:21.050
Leave this kind of thing to me.

00:12:21.050 --> 00:12:23.050
Hello?

00:12:23.050 --> 00:12:24.640
Can you hear me?

00:12:24.640 --> 00:12:28.390
Let's talk this over calmly!

00:12:28.390 --> 00:12:30.850
What's your motive?

00:12:30.850 --> 00:12:34.730
I'll help in any way I can!

00:12:40.150 --> 00:12:41.030
Nope.

00:12:41.030 --> 00:12:43.280
They're totally ignoring you.

00:12:54.120 --> 00:12:55.760
It's a Beystadium!

00:12:56.130 --> 00:12:58.340
We would like a battle.

00:12:58.340 --> 00:13:01.380
A battle with Takao Kinomiya,
the world champion.

00:13:02.010 --> 00:13:03.550
A battle?

00:13:03.550 --> 00:13:05.220
With that top game?

00:13:08.410 --> 00:13:10.430
Now that's a laugh!

00:13:10.430 --> 00:13:15.560
You jumped through all these
hoops just to challenge me?

00:13:15.560 --> 00:13:18.480
Exactly. We want to test your skill.

00:13:18.480 --> 00:13:21.860
Will you accept our challenge?

00:13:22.250 --> 00:13:23.920
Yeah, I will!

00:13:23.920 --> 00:13:27.030
In exchange, let Kyoujyu and Hiromi go!

00:13:27.030 --> 00:13:28.990
This has nothing to do with them.

00:13:28.990 --> 00:13:33.120
Very well. But that's
if you defeat us.

00:13:33.120 --> 00:13:34.080
What?

00:13:34.080 --> 00:13:37.420
If you lose, they will die.

00:13:38.420 --> 00:13:39.790
That's a joke, right?

00:13:39.790 --> 00:13:42.050
I think they're serious.

00:13:42.050 --> 00:13:43.420
Wait a sec!

00:13:43.420 --> 00:13:46.970
Why do I have to be
your bargaining chip?!

00:13:46.970 --> 00:13:50.680
Nooo! Let me out! Let me out!

00:13:50.680 --> 00:13:53.520
Well, Kinomiya?

00:13:53.520 --> 00:13:55.600
I don't have any other choice.

00:13:55.600 --> 00:13:56.940
I accept!

00:13:56.940 --> 00:14:00.060
Takao! Don't be selfish!

00:14:00.060 --> 00:14:03.530
You're gonna win for sure, right?

00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:04.610
Probably!

00:14:04.610 --> 00:14:06.020
"Probably"...

00:14:06.280 --> 00:14:07.650
No!!

00:14:07.650 --> 00:14:10.120
--We have no choice! We have to rely on Takao.

00:14:11.120 --> 00:14:13.230
Don't worry, Hiromi.

00:14:15.540 --> 00:14:17.330
I'll save you both. Count on it.

00:14:23.250 --> 00:14:25.800
Now then, who am I gonna fight?

00:14:25.800 --> 00:14:27.260
Come on out!

00:14:28.680 --> 00:14:30.800
Your opponent...

00:14:30.800 --> 00:14:32.550
is right in front of you!

00:14:44.820 --> 00:14:45.860
What is that?!

00:15:02.210 --> 00:15:04.050
A robot?

00:15:06.460 --> 00:15:08.880
I don't know who
you think you are,

00:15:09.510 --> 00:15:12.150
but don't underestimate Takao Kinomiya!

00:15:12.800 --> 00:15:14.470
Adrenaline, 1,000.

00:15:14.470 --> 00:15:16.350
Protein gain, 800.

00:15:16.350 --> 00:15:18.820
Mental readings, 1,500.

00:15:20.060 --> 00:15:23.700
I'm not holding
back against a robot!

00:15:25.320 --> 00:15:27.530
Go Shoot!

00:15:29.990 --> 00:15:31.710
Go, Dragoon!

00:15:37.160 --> 00:15:38.760
It dodged!

00:15:47.750 --> 00:15:49.880
And I believe that's game.

00:15:49.880 --> 00:15:51.430
No!!

00:15:51.430 --> 00:15:53.510
I don't wanna die!

00:15:53.510 --> 00:15:56.260
Wait! One more!
One more battle!

00:15:56.260 --> 00:15:59.020
I don't think the result
will be any different.

00:15:59.520 --> 00:16:02.230
I let my guard down
because I'm fighting a robot!

00:16:02.230 --> 00:16:04.310
I'm going all out this time!

00:16:04.770 --> 00:16:07.360
Takao, take this seriously!

00:16:07.360 --> 00:16:10.780
Don't you realize that
our lives are on the line?!

00:16:11.030 --> 00:16:12.280
I know!

00:16:12.280 --> 00:16:13.860
Go Shoot!

00:16:14.660 --> 00:16:15.990
Go, Dragoon!

00:16:18.660 --> 00:16:20.580
Takao, behind you!

00:16:20.580 --> 00:16:22.350
Dragoon, dodge!

00:16:26.340 --> 00:16:27.340
Takao!

00:16:27.340 --> 00:16:28.550
Dragoon!

00:16:32.590 --> 00:16:34.970
Don't make fun of me...

00:16:34.970 --> 00:16:36.600
Adrenaline, 2,000!

00:16:36.600 --> 00:16:38.350
Protein gain, 3,000!

00:16:38.350 --> 00:16:40.220
Mental readings, 4,000!

00:16:40.350 --> 00:16:42.180
Go, Dragoon!

00:16:47.360 --> 00:16:48.940
What are you trying to attack?

00:16:48.940 --> 00:16:50.980
And you call yourself the world champion?!

00:16:50.980 --> 00:16:53.800
All of his moves are being predicted!

00:16:54.530 --> 00:16:56.620
Attack, and it dodges.

00:16:56.620 --> 00:16:58.950
Dodge and it counterattacks.

00:16:59.580 --> 00:17:04.350
I hypothesize that they inputted
Takao's movement patterns into it.

00:17:05.000 --> 00:17:05.870
That means...

00:17:05.870 --> 00:17:08.100
There's no way Takao can win!

00:17:08.750 --> 00:17:10.710
That can't be true!

00:17:10.710 --> 00:17:14.010
Takao, forget the cleaning. Just win, please!

00:17:14.300 --> 00:17:16.050
If he could summon his Sacred Beast...

00:17:22.020 --> 00:17:23.810
Too bad for you, Mr. Kinomiya.

00:17:23.810 --> 00:17:27.060
I thought that you were
a more talented Blader.

00:17:27.060 --> 00:17:29.560
And now, as I promised...

00:17:35.990 --> 00:17:37.070
What's happening?

00:17:37.070 --> 00:17:38.410
They're pushing in!

00:17:40.030 --> 00:17:41.440
It won't stop!

00:17:42.080 --> 00:17:43.870
Wait! One more battle!

00:17:43.870 --> 00:17:45.500
Gimme one more chance!

00:17:45.500 --> 00:17:46.460
Very well.

00:17:46.460 --> 00:17:49.940
But can you win?
Before they're crushed, that is.

00:17:55.550 --> 00:17:56.880
--Takao!

00:17:56.880 --> 00:17:58.470
Darn it...

00:17:58.470 --> 00:18:00.050
Adrenaline, 5,000!

00:18:00.300 --> 00:18:02.100
Protein gain, 900!

00:18:02.220 --> 00:18:03.970
Mental readings, 10,000!

00:18:03.970 --> 00:18:05.250
Mr. Gideon!

00:18:06.480 --> 00:18:08.630
Go Shoot!

00:18:14.360 --> 00:18:16.650
Release it, now!

00:18:16.650 --> 00:18:18.690
Release your Sacred Beast!

00:18:23.370 --> 00:18:24.790
Takao!

00:18:25.290 --> 00:18:27.550
I refuse to lose!

00:18:33.000 --> 00:18:34.240
What's happening?

00:18:42.720 --> 00:18:43.990
Seiryu!

00:18:46.930 --> 00:18:49.230
So this is a Sacred Beast?

00:18:49.230 --> 00:18:52.020
Go, Dragoon!

00:18:55.280 --> 00:18:57.990
Now! Capture his Sacred Beast!

00:18:57.990 --> 00:19:00.070
Capture system has been activated!

00:19:17.260 --> 00:19:19.120
You cannot escape.

00:19:24.430 --> 00:19:26.850
Dragoon!

00:19:30.520 --> 00:19:31.540
What?!

00:19:38.780 --> 00:19:40.110
It stopped...

00:19:40.110 --> 00:19:41.450
We're safe...

00:19:55.090 --> 00:19:56.820
--Takao!

00:19:57.800 --> 00:20:00.180
Takao! Stay with us!

00:20:05.140 --> 00:20:06.870
We need to get out
of here, and fast!

00:20:16.650 --> 00:20:18.730
Now I've bore witness...

00:20:18.730 --> 00:20:21.070
to the power of a Sacred Beast...

00:20:39.050 --> 00:20:40.670
He's awake!

00:20:40.670 --> 00:20:42.760
Had us worried there, Takao!

00:20:44.630 --> 00:20:45.890
Kyoujyu...

00:20:45.890 --> 00:20:47.300
Hiromi...

00:20:47.470 --> 00:20:50.060
The battle! How
did the battle end?

00:20:51.220 --> 00:20:52.890
You won, Takao.

00:20:52.890 --> 00:20:55.270
We were in trouble for a little bit, there.

00:20:56.150 --> 00:20:57.520
I won?

00:20:58.320 --> 00:21:00.280
I will not lose!

00:21:07.530 --> 00:21:08.580
Kyoujyu!

00:21:08.910 --> 00:21:09.950
Yes!

00:21:09.950 --> 00:21:12.290
You did it, Takao!

00:21:13.580 --> 00:21:17.710
Seiryu! I finally summoned Seiryu!

00:22:59.020 --> 00:23:03.440
Chairman, have you completely forgotten about one of the members of the BBA Team?

00:23:03.440 --> 00:23:04.820
It's Kai! Kai!

00:23:04.820 --> 00:23:08.240
We haven't seen him
since the world championships,

00:23:08.240 --> 00:23:11.530
But a mysterious tough opponent
has appeared before Kai!

00:23:11.530 --> 00:23:13.370
Is there some Kai-nda problem?

00:23:13.370 --> 00:23:15.790
We can't do that, Chairman!

00:23:15.790 --> 00:23:17.950
That's the one dad
joke we can't say!

00:23:17.950 --> 00:23:20.290
Keep your Kai's glued
on the next episode too, okay?
